    <description>08/31/2026 - Case 00008361 - Create the calendar Event when Service Appointment scheduling changes and the Assigned Resource Event was missed. Preserves the existing idempotent update path and supports multiple appointments for the same engineer on the same day. 11/25/2025 (BW) - Updating so that this doesn&apos;t error if a service crew is assigned.</description>
